angle between the vectors $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 7 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ \\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}].$" :question/requires-calculator true :question/worked-solution "Using the formula\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta =\\frac{v\\cdot w}{‖v‖\\,‖w‖},\n$$\n\nwe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{v}_{1}{w}_{1}+{v}_{2}{w}_{2}+{v}_{3}{w}_{3}+{v}_{4}{w}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{v}_{1}^{2}+{v}_{2}^{2}+{v}_{3}^{2}+{v}_{4}^{2}}\\sqrt{{w}_{1}^{2}+{w}_{2}^{2}+{w}_{3}^{2}+{w}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot (-1)+(-\\sqrt{5})\\cdot 1+7\\cdot 5+1\\cdot \\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-\\sqrt{5})^{2}+{7}^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{1}^{2}+{5}^{2}+(\\sqrt{5})^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{\\sqrt{64}\\cdot \\sqrt{32}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{32}}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})=\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414662 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133774 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6bde92b0-4e98-5c2e-848e-7a5febc848ae" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Acute Angle Between Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2bff7206-3e83-5486-87f5-627306292967" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414646} {:answer/id #uuid "385da54c-4492-5bbc-951a-ed5c5080d241" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414647} {:answer/id #uuid "c9aa9be2-fd88-5217-83f7-344e4baf419e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414656} {:answer/id #uuid "d4a61390-9440-51e4-aed8-0f77831ed9d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :